  "description_short": "Charming Mossel Bay café serving quality coffee, fresh pastries, and light meals in a relaxed, welcoming space.",
  "description_long": "Tucked away at the corner of Bland and Field Streets, De Huijs has become a favourite among locals and visitors seeking a quiet moment in Mossel Bay. This welcoming café combines the warmth of a neighbourhood coffee shop with the quality of a proper food store, offering freshly baked goods, artisan coffee, and a selection of light meals throughout the day.\n\nThe relaxed atmosphere makes it ideal for a morning coffee and pastry, a leisurely lunch, or an afternoon pick-me-up. Their shelves are stocked with carefully selected provisions, and the baked goods are consistently fresh. Whether you're grabbing takeaway or settling in with a book, De Huijs delivers that comfortable, unpretentious café experience that keeps people coming back.\n\nWith its convenient town location and genuinely friendly service, it's the kind of place where regulars know each other by name and newcomers quickly feel at home.",
